    {"question": "Are you licensed in Washington?", "answer": "Yes — Apex Grid Engineering is licensed in 49 states plus DC, and every sealed sheet comes from a licensed PE in responsible charge. For a developer building in Vancouver, that means the same accountable engineering team from the first site to the fifth, with no handoffs between firms."}
